WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Lao Gu, you laugh so hard

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,120
It's a bit like the expression on Chen Haoyu's face when that bastard tried to trick me.

3
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:07,480
Training is over for everyone

4
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:09,080
I'll give you an hour to wash up.

5
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:12,160
Let’s go to Qianyuanhai immediately

6
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,280
You don't follow the rules

7
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:16,180
Damn, help us act like fools

8
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,540
I didn't force you

9
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:18,900
It's what you begged for

10
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,830
So you already knew you were going out today

11
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:25,320
I'll go. Don't waste it.

12
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:27,980
Little daddy, I’ll give you half

13
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:29,500
Silly thin clothes

14
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:30,580
They are all going out

15
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:31,780
I'll bear with you

16
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:35,980
Wait a minute and smoke three in one breath

17
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:37,740
Since you smoked my cigarette

18
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:40,340
Then do something for me

19
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:42,850
Isn’t it enough to do the task in time?

20
00:00:42,850 --> 00:00:45,570
Hua Doudou doesn’t want to pay

21
00:00:45,570 --> 00:00:47,610
Your pack of cigarettes costs eighteen yuan, right?

22
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:50,050
Please ask No. 99 for only ten yuan. You still lose money, right?
